    <link>https://www.reinsurancene.ws/koreyva-to-succeed-cary-as-gallaghers-controller-and-chief-accounting-officer/</link>
    <description>Koreyva has been appointed Controller and Chief Accounting Officer, and principal accounting officer of Arthur J. Gallagher &amp; Co.’s Controller since 1997 and its Chief Accounting Officer since 2001. He initially joined the organisation in August 2025 through its acquisition of AssuredPartners, where he had served as Chief Accounting Officer since June 2024 before becoming Gallagher’s Vice President of Accounting.</description>
